    <body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0447.elenephoroyntes.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0447.elenephoroyntes.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0447_elenephoroyntes">
        <head>ΕΛΕΝΗΦΟΡΟΥΝΤΕΣ.</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="unnumbered" ana="#compiled-unnumbered-fragment" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered-l1">Ὦ τόνδ᾽ ἐποπτεύουσα καὶ κεκτημένη</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered-l2">Βραυρῶνος ἱεροῦ θεοφιλέστατον τόπον,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered-l3">Λητοῦς Διός τε τοξόδαμνε παρθένε,</l>
            <l n="4" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered-l4">ὡς οἱ τραγῳδοί φασιν, οἷς ἐξουσία</l>
            <l n="5" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered-l5">ἔστιν λέγειν ἅπαντα καὶ ποιεῖν μόνοις.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Athenaeus VI p. 223 a. de tragicorum prae comicis poetis commodis agens: <quote>Δίφιλος δ᾽ Ἑλενηφοροῦσιν <lg>
                <l n="6" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered-l6">Ὦ τόνδ᾽ ἐποπτεύουσα</l>
              </lg> κτλ.</quote>
          </note>
          <note type="apparatus">Vs. 1 cod. B ὑποπτεύουσα. — Vs. 2 P βραύσωνος. Ibid. Dindorfius ἱροῦ. Non imiter, neque hic neque aliis tragicorum locis, quibus eandem formam restituit. De Braurone, Dianae cultu nobilitato, v. Leakium de Demis attic. ed. Westerm. p. 60 sq.</note>
          <note type="footnote">*) V. Hist. crit. p. 453.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="unnumbered_2" ana="#compiled-unnumbered-fragment #compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered_2">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered_2-l1">O quae regens haec numine invisis tuo,</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered_2-l2">amica Divis, sacra Brauronis loca,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered_2-l3">arcidoma virgo nata Latonae ac Iovis,</l>
            <l n="4" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered_2-l4">tragici ut loquuntur magna libertas quibus</l>
            <l n="5" xml:id="meineke-0447-elenephoroyntes-unnumbered_2-l5">concessa fari ac facere quod libitum est modo.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
